Publish internal services at https:// names

Usage:
  olr ingress [command]

Available Commands:
  add         Publish a service at a name
  disable     Stop publishing services
  enable      Start publishing services
  logs        Show the proxy's log output
  rm          Stop publishing a service
  set         Set how certificates are obtained
  show        Show ingress configuration
  status      Show whether the proxy and its certificate are healthy

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for ingress

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")

Use "olr ingress [command] --help" for more information about a command.
